{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/line.png?t=1731813467\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/NightingNailTitleSilver.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/border.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A demon, hellbent on destruction. An exorcist, determined that light will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Which will you be tonight?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From TurboMassiveGames comes <strong>NightingNail</strong>, an enthralling 1v1 PvP experience set in a beautifully stylized gothic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/border02.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/steam_animatedsplashVFX.gif?t=1731813467\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/overview.png?t=1731813467\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/quote.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into this atmospheric world where deception reigns. <strong>NightingNail</strong> is a game of cunning, strategy, and chaos, where outsmarting your opponent is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/CHOOSE.png?t=1731813467\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/croppedexorcist.gif?t=1731813467\" /><strong>Fend off evil as the Exorcist</strong>: A holy figure tasked with protecting innocent villagers. Seek out the evil lurking within the shadows, casting spells and laying ambushes. Use your wit and skill to expose the demon concealed in your midst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Or embrace your darker nature as the Demon</strong>: A sinister creature of stealth and malevolence, armed with a sharpened nail of unholy proportions. Stab, outrun, and kill your way to victory, bringing hell to earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/croppeddemon.gif?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this gothic game of hide and seek, each player must defeat the other in intense one-on-one battles. Each and every choice can lead to triumph, or to defeat. The demon must claim a  number of villagers' lives - all the while at risk of being discovered by the exorcist. The exorcist must uncover the demon's identity before he takes the lives of the innocents - the village\u2019s very survival hangs in a precarious balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1731813467\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Abilities</strong>: Harness your character's distinct powers to outmaneuver your opponent. How will you secure victory tonight?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense PvP</strong>: Challenge your friends (and foes) in thrilling 1v1 matches to determine the ultimate victor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong>: Crafted in Unreal Engine 5, explore a beautifully designed gothic world that enhances your gameplay experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ready to fight?</strong> Wishlist <strong>NightingNail</strong> and stay updated by following our social media pages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/line.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/croppedmap.gif?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3199110?t=1731813467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3199110?t=1731813467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/955db5fd4311d8ebf97dde4b59a1840bb75559c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731813467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/955db5fd4311d8ebf97dde4b59a1840bb75559c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731813467","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Acts of Violence (killing villagers via nail)"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/line.png?t=1731813467\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/NightingNailTitleSilver.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199110/extras/border.png?t=1731813467\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>